    "funFacts": [
     "Answering a compliment with 哪里哪里 literally asks ‘where? where?’ — as if the praised quality cannot be found."
    ],
    "pitfalls": [
     "No 吗 with 哪里: 土豆在哪里？ (not *…吗？).",
     "哪里 nǎli (where?) vs 那里 nàli (there): only the 口 radical and the tone differ.",
     "Say 在哪里 for ‘where is’ — the verb 在 is needed: *土豆哪里？"
    ],
    "subtleties": [
